==History==
*On 06/07/17, Gems from Gem Packs were increased: 20/50/110/230/600/1250 ➞ 30/80/170/350/900/1850
*On 19/06/18, Gems were made available in all [[Brawl Boxes]]. Gems had a 9% drop rate and within that chance, a 61% chance for 3 Gems, 27% chance for 5 Gems, 9% chance for 8 Gems, and a 3% chance for 12 Gems. Additionally, Legendary Brawlers were made available for Brawler Offers.
*On 12/12/18, Gems from the 3 highest Gem Packs were increased: 350/900/1850 ➞ 360/950/2000
*On 13/05/20, Gems were removed from Brawl Boxes and added to the free tiers of the [[Brawl Pass]] with 90 Gems per Brawl Pass season.
*On 12/12/23, the number of Gems on the free tiers of the [[Brawl Pass]] was decreased to 50 Gems per season (from 90). Gems were added to the paid side of the Brawl Pass and the Brawl Pass Plus with 50 Gems each per season.
*On 29/10/24, Gems were made available in all [[Trophy Boxes]].
*On 25/02/25, Gems were added to the free and paid tiers of the [[Pro Pass]], with 50 and 600 Gems, respectively, per Pro Pass season.
*On 03/09/25, local prices were adjusted in over 100 countries in Latin America, Africa, Eastern Europe, and Southeast and Central Asia.
*On 16/12/25, the number of Gems on the Brawl Pass Plus was increased to 100 Gems per season (from 50).

